cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Schism, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Schism: inject, tune or ablate one behaviour of a language model"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill that injects, tunes or ablates one behaviour of a language
  model by intervening in its weight space and on its internal
  representations, or through a prompt operator on closed models, and proves
  that the rest of the model held.
